### 變數設定
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081/api/bookings
@authUrl = http://localhost:8081/api/auth
@bookingId = 2
@checkInDate = 2026-08-23
@status = 已入住

### 0. 登入獲取 JWT Token
# @name login
POST {{authUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin01",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 自動綁定 Token
@jwtToken = {{login.response.body.token}}


### 1. 依 ID 查詢單筆預訂 (GET /api/bookings/{id})
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{bookingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### 2. 依入住日期查詢 (GET /api/bookings/check-in?date=yyyy-MM-dd)
GET {{baseUrl}}/check-in?date={{checkInDate}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### 3. 依訂單狀態查詢 (GET /api/bookings/status?status=...)
GET {{baseUrl}}/status?status={{status}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### 4. 更新預訂 (PUT /api/bookings/{id})
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{bookingId}}
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": {{bookingId}},
  "bookingStatus": "CONFIRMED",
  "checkInDate": "2026-08-25",
  "checkOutDate": "2026-08-28",
  "bookingOrder": {
    "bookingOrderId": 1
  },
  "roomType": {
    "roomTypeId": 2
  },
  "room": {
    "roomId": 5
  }
}

### 5. 刪除預訂 (DELETE /api/bookings/{id})
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{bookingId}}
Authorization: {{auth}}